---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Themes
description: A small, growing catalogue of themes for Pegasus environments.
theme: dark
permalink: /themes/
---
<section class="themes-editorial">
  <header class="themes-editorial__header">
    <div><h1>Choose a mood.<br><em>Keep control.</em></h1></div>
  </header>
  <div class="themes-editorial__layout">
    <div class="listing-grid">{% for theme in collections.themes %}{% set theme_item = theme %}{% include "components/theme-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <aside class="themes-editorial__aside" aria-label="Theme catalogue notes">
      <div class="themes-editorial__aside-block"><p class="editorial-label">Visual index</p><p><strong>{{ collections.themes | length }} palettes</strong><br>Each entry pairs a real preview with its source metadata and seven-color palette.</p></div>
      <div class="themes-editorial__aside-block"><p class="editorial-label">Read the card</p><p>Open a theme to inspect its palette, source repository, and available wallpaper asset.</p></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
